{
  "spec_version": "corpan.storygraph.v0.1",
  "quest_id": "all_hearing_ear",
  "title": "On the Trail of the All-Hearing Ear",
  "description": "A braided, checkpoint-based quest where choices alter state, but the narrative reconnects at hubs.",
  "start_scene_id": "S00_START",
  "globals": {
    "max_replays_per_scene": 99,
    "default_language": "en"
  },
  "state_schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "vars": {
      "ear_fragments": { "type": "int", "min": 0, "max": 7, "default": 0 },
      "trust_kendi": { "type": "int", "min": -3, "max": 5, "default": 0 },
      "trust_pari": { "type": "int", "min": -3, "max": 5, "default": 0 },
      "vow_silence": { "type": "bool", "default": false },
      "learned_pack_ids": { "type": "set_string", "default": [] },
      "pron_score": { "type": "int", "min": 0, "max": 100, "default": 0 },
      "visited": { "type": "set_string", "default": [] }
    }
  },
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "S00_START",
      "type": "scene",
      "title": "The Hum Under the City",
      "text": [
        "A faint vibration lives inside every wall: not sound, but a suggestion of sound.",
        "Some call it myth. Some call it data. You call it a trail."
      ],
      "on_enter": [
        { "op": "add_set", "var": "visited", "value": "S00_START" }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "C00A",
          "label": "Follow the hum into the market district",
          "to": "H10_HUB_MARKET",
          "effects": [
            { "op": "add_set", "var": "visited", "value": "PATH_MARKET" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "C00B",
          "label": "Take the service tunnels below street level",
          "to": "H20_HUB_TUNNELS",
          "effects": [
            { "op": "add_set", "var": "visited", "value": "PATH_TUNNELS" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "H10_HUB_MARKET",
      "type": "hub",
      "title": "Hub: Market of Whispered Tongues",
      "text": [
        "Stalls sell fruit, circuits, and old books with new ink.",
        "Kendi appears beside a vendor who never looks up."
      ],
      "on_enter": [
        { "op": "add_set", "var": "visited", "value": "H10_HUB_MARKET" }
      ],
      "choices": [
        { "id": "H10Q1", "label": "Quest: The Vendor's Riddle", "to": "D11_ENTRY_VENDOR" },
        { "id": "H10Q2", "label": "Quest: Kendi's Shortcut", "to": "D12_ENTRY_KENDI" },
        {
          "id": "H10ADV",
          "label": "Advance to the next checkpoint (requires 1 ear fragment)",
          "to": "H30_HUB_TEMPLE_APPROACH",
          "requires": [{ "op": "gte", "var": "ear_fragments", "value": 1 }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "D11_ENTRY_VENDOR",
      "type": "diamond_entry",
      "title": "The Vendor's Riddle",
      "text": [
        "The vendor slides you a paper slip: three lines in a language you almost recognize."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "D11A",
          "label": "Try a respectful translation attempt",
          "to": "D11_MERGE_VENDOR",
          "effects": [{ "op": "inc", "var": "trust_pari", "value": 1 }]
        },
        {
          "id": "D11B",
          "label": "Offer a trade instead of an answer",
          "to": "D11_MERGE_VENDOR",
          "effects": [{ "op": "inc", "var": "trust_kendi", "value": 1 }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "D11_MERGE_VENDOR",
      "type": "diamond_merge",
      "title": "A Slip of Paper",
      "text": [
        "The vendor finally meets your eyes and presses something into your palm: a thin shard shaped like an ear."
      ],
      "on_enter": [
        { "op": "inc", "var": "ear_fragments", "value": 1 }
      ],
      "choices": [
        { "id": "D11BACK", "label": "Back to Market Hub", "to": "H10_HUB_MARKET" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "D12_ENTRY_KENDI",
      "type": "scene",
      "title": "Kendi's Shortcut",
      "text": [
        "Kendi grins. 'I know a faster way. But it costs... a phrase.'"
      ],
      "choices": [
        { "id": "D12BACK", "label": "Back to Market Hub", "to": "H10_HUB_MARKET" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "H20_HUB_TUNNELS",
      "type": "hub",
      "title": "Hub: Service Tunnels",
      "text": [
        "Below the city, the hum becomes a rhythm.",
        "Somewhere ahead, a door repeats your footsteps back at you."
      ],
      "choices": [
        { "id": "H20Q1", "label": "Quest: Echo Door", "to": "D21_ENTRY_ECHO" },
        {
          "id": "H20ADV",
          "label": "Advance to Temple Approach (requires 1 ear fragment)",
          "to": "H30_HUB_TEMPLE_APPROACH",
          "requires": [{ "op": "gte", "var": "ear_fragments", "value": 1 }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "D21_ENTRY_ECHO",
      "type": "scene",
      "title": "The Echo Door",
      "text": [
        "The door hums back every sound you make, slightly altered."
      ],
      "on_enter": [
        { "op": "inc", "var": "ear_fragments", "value": 1 }
      ],
      "choices": [
        { "id": "D21BACK", "label": "Back to Tunnels Hub", "to": "H20_HUB_TUNNELS" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "H30_HUB_TEMPLE_APPROACH",
      "type": "hub",
      "title": "Hub: The Temple Approach",
      "text": [
        "The stone ahead is old, but the geometry is new.",
        "You can feel the All-Hearing Ear listening without ears."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "H30FIN",
          "label": "Enter the threshold (requires 2 fragments)",
          "to": "S90_FINALE",
          "requires": [{ "op": "gte", "var": "ear_fragments", "value": 2 }]
        },
        { "id": "H30BACK1", "label": "Return to Market Hub", "to": "H10_HUB_MARKET" },
        { "id": "H30BACK2", "label": "Return to Tunnels Hub", "to": "H20_HUB_TUNNELS" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S90_FINALE",
      "type": "scene",
      "title": "Finale: The All-Hearing Ear",
      "text": [
        "No treasure chest. No boss fight.",
        "Only a question that listens back: What did you become on the way here?"
      ],
      "choices": [
        { "id": "END", "label": "End (for now)", "to": null }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
